<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "IEEE 1484.12.3" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "LOM XML Binding" <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An IEEE standard defining a W3C XML Schema binding for the Learning Object Metadata (LOM) data model so LOM metadata instances can be encoded in XML and exchanged consistently between systems." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/scheme> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
