<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-1-2020-learning-object-metadata> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/activeDefinition> <https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata-1> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "The binding turns the abstract LOM model into an interoperable XML representation that software can validate, exchange, and process consistently." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/ieee-1484-12-3-2020-xml-binding-learning-object-metadata/versions/1> .
